      "name": "research-manager",
      "title": "Research manager — alternatives on cards, chosen by priority, pursued by siblings",
      "description": "Run research as a managed portfolio of alternatives: when a goal has more than one way forward, put every alternative on a research-path card with its cost, risk and commitment and one recommended, prioritise which to pursue, dispatch a sibling research thread (or agent) per chosen path with a bean of its own, record the rejected paths, prod stalled children, and report usage-limit pauses instead of prodding them. Use for \"pursue the alternatives\", \"which route should we try\", \"dispatch research agents\", \"research manager\", and whenever a thread ends with more than one possible next direction.",
